                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "171a0e3c-4195-3a8f-93e6-45b047ff683a",
                                        "entry_id": "835684e9-81f1-3c01-9ffe-91ad80ba3051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of numerous species of insect in the order Coleoptera characterized by a pair of hard, shell-like front wings which cover and protect a pair of rear wings when at rest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6aa7448-fac3-39ba-b63d-8328146c5ef0",
                                        "entry_id": "835684e9-81f1-3c01-9ffe-91ad80ba3051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game of chance in which players attempt to complete a drawing of a beetle, different dice rolls allowing them to add the various body parts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58baf6f5-7b64-4d0d-940b-e7d618aee3a0",
                                                "sense_id": "e6aa7448-fac3-39ba-b63d-8328146c5ef0",
                                                "text": "Guessing competitions were tackled with much enthusiasm, followed by a beetle drive, and judging by the laughter, this was popular with all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c07248d0-e9e2-31fd-8a20-a22f11a23792",
                                        "entry_id": "835684e9-81f1-3c01-9ffe-91ad80ba3051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative letter-case form of Beetle (“car”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b65ddd9-fc8e-4333-a60a-f3c1a042be3f",
                                                "sense_id": "c07248d0-e9e2-31fd-8a20-a22f11a23792",
                                                "text": "For quotations using this term, see Citations:beetle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "beetle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                        "entry_id": "a84a05ad-288b-38e4-b6c0-aaa37e21c588",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move (away) quickly, to scurry away."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc38f2b4-0243-4848-bb59-e25bec17ec1c",
                                                "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                                "text": "He beetled off on his vacation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be289b76-c90e-4082-806f-37f2210b7d8f",
                                                "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                                "text": "I beetled across to our table, but no Pauline, no Mr Cresswell, no Mr Rudyard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c1bbe56-6409-482e-91d6-6dd0bcd1adee",
                                                "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                                "text": "“[…] But he seems to have beetled off somewhere as usual. […]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50e0e99e-2a2e-4133-a616-6e52a7aae9a0",
                                                "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                                "text": "In the falling darkness Harry saw small collections of lights as they passed over more villages, then a winding road on which a single car was beetling its way home through the hills. …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50711e9d-538f-4f64-8104-1797457973d1",
                                                "sense_id": "f01c80a2-9663-39f8-882a-408d58123311",
                                                "text": "Her eyes still closed, his aunt smiled cruelly. “I know what you are dying to say, Bertie. Go ahead—take the cheap shot. I’ll squash you like the nasty little bug you are.” ¶ Thus chastened, the little man beetled away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "beetle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42b85740-19fb-3238-b747-cdc44b5de8cb",
                                        "entry_id": "334bb073-64e7-3da9-aaa6-9a6e1ca9e321",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Protruding, jutting, overhanging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd454f5-2be9-429c-9d01-088ade376d0d",
                                                "sense_id": "42b85740-19fb-3238-b747-cdc44b5de8cb",
                                                "text": "beetle brows"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "beetle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                        "entry_id": "f932a785-5e51-3be9-9a4e-f7cdfce71531",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To loom over; to extend or jut (above)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea0ae599-7233-4372-a480-b5c437f81277",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "The heavy chimney beetled over the thatched roof."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d0e8f4-7096-4add-b3a6-be366d620749",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "To the dreadful summit of the cliff / That beetles o'er his base into the sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8920994e-1b1c-4938-9742-6b849b088b6a",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "Each beetling rampart, and each tower sublime."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e076d203-fbac-418e-bb40-3978e869c47e",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "I was indeed gently affected, and shared his fears, remembering well the bulging walls of the old house, and the toppling mass of heavy chimney work which beetled over the roof, beneath which these poor doves had made their nest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7019562a-5b1e-4145-bd4f-1c7215d7981e",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "He stood a barehead boy upon a cliff / Pine-crowned, that hung high beetling a bleak north sea, / His long bright hair did stream like yellow silk, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b7a230-443a-4871-9296-e3ab05f989bd",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "Impelled by some obscure quest, I ascended a rift or cleft in this beetling precipice, noting as I did so the black mouths of many fearsome burrows extending from both walls into the depths of the stony plateau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06e1d8d5-2124-40ea-88de-6ddac93dc4e5",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e79809-c7df-3996-b852-0440ab92f1e4",
                                                "text": "By the power of an imperious spirit, Peter was able to extend his meagre five feet two in space by expanding his chest, cocking his crest, inflating his whiskers, and beetling his brows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
